OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA widely cloudy start to the
OL,6,Fday with some patchy rain in the west.
OL,7,FCloud breaking at times in the east
OL,8,Fand south of the region to leave a
OL,9,Fbright afternoon here. Gentle winds
OL,10,Fwith near average temperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FVariable cloud through the
OL,13,Fevening with light rain developing for
OL,14,Fthe Sussex coast. Further rain
OL,15,Farriving overnight but the odd clearer
OL,16,Fspell possible too. Light winds,
OL,17,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
