OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy to start with patchy
OL,6,Flight rain. Cloud breaking with some
OL,7,Freasonable bright spells developing.
OL,8,FLight winds with temperatures
OL,9,Fremaining around average. Mist and fog
OL,10,Fdeveloping overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure continues to dominate,
OL,14,Fhowever, cloud cover likely to break
OL,15,Fup allowing overnight mist and fog to
OL,16,Fdevelop, which will then clear slowly.
OL,17,FTemperatures remain around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
